{
  "@context": "https://www.w3.org/2022/wot/td/v1.1",
  "@type": "tm:ThingModel",
  "title": "Module: where copper is lost",
  "titles": {
    "en": "Module: where copper is lost",
    "ru": "Модуль «Где теряется медь»"
  },
  "description": "Written by akt-losses every 5 model minutes; node keys sag-N, cyclones-N, flot-N. suspect_sensors: instruments whose reading the module doubts (thing names). Silent overspends: SAG kWh/t measured against Morrell on the batch estimate (sag-N_e_*, energy_usd_h), collector tank balance against the flowmeter (rougher-N_reagent_*), water balance residual as a leak (water_leak_m3h); silent_text sums them up.",
  "version": {
    "model": "1.0.0"
  },
